.TH PRODBOX_config 1
.SH NAME
prodbox-config \- Configuration management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodbox config
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configuration commands for the binary-sibling document or an explicitly selected path.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBsetup\fR
Interactively author config
.TP
\fBshow\fR
Display current config
.TP
\fBvalidate\fR
Validate current config
.TP
\fBschema\fR
Regenerate Dhall schema files
.TP
\fBgenerate\fR
Generate the default non-secret config
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBprodbox config validate\fR
Validate prodbox.dhall before running lifecycle commands.
